    "description": "\"Asphalt Escort\" Fixed Carbine Buttstock: FFFTech/FFFTechnology\n\nA minimalist, lightweight, fixed buttstock similar in length to the Magpul Fixed Carbine Buttstock. The rear section is \nangled at 85 deg for better recoil control and ease of shouldering. Has a single 34mm long, vertical sling loop.\n\nComes with two buttpads: \n\n * Standard, 8mm thick\n * Extended, 16mm thick\n\n\nThis buttstock is designed for Milspec Carbine Buffer Tubes only. \n\nUpdate V1.0.1: Forgotten to specify no support material needed anywhere EXCEPT the sling loop hole. Added parameter for \nsupport material percentage needed and specification of where the support material is needed.\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 225C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .2mm\nWall Perimeters: 6+\nInfill: 20%+\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 16%\n\nNO support material is needed EXCEPT in the sling loop hole.\n\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x M8x10 Hex Socketed Set Screw\n\n2x M4x12 Screws",
